1f:["$","div",null,{"className":"ms-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"why-reviews","children":"Why reviews"}],"\n",["$","div","p-0",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"E-commerce search fails silently, and the fix lives in the only dataset that will tell you why: reviews. People don't file tickets for a dead-end search, but they do review the app that failed them."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","The dataset",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The dataset"}],["$","i",null,{"children":"the only dataset that will tell you why: reviews"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"the-mechanism","children":"The mechanism"}],"\n",["$","div","p-1",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"I built an agentic extractor on the Reddit, App Store and Play Store APIs that pulls raw review text at scale, then a 6-stage SQL pipeline that cleans, deduplicates and tags it. Across 94.6K reviews the pipeline isolates the root causes of search failure instead of one fuzzy complaint category."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","The pipeline",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The pipeline"}],["$","i",null,{"children":"a 6-stage SQL pipeline that cleans, deduplicates and tags it"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"four-root-causes-four-treatments","children":"Four root causes, four treatments"}],"\n",["$","div","p-2",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["The mining surfaced four causes: vague intent, missing filter context, spelling and slang drift, and catalog gaps that no query could ever fix. ",["$","mark","0",{"className":"mk","children":"Each cause got its own treatment instead of one generic \"no results\" page."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","pq",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"Pull quote"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Select any line to reply"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"what-it-informed","children":"What it informed"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"The causes became the product plan for AskCart: a guided follow-up flow for vague intent and missing context, and a semantic fallback for the code-mixed queries the lexicon never reaches. The extractor still runs as the eval source of truth for the search index."}]]}]}]
